{"id":"n62195-1-7","stage":4,"title":"산뜻하다 · 清爽","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62195-1-7-1","ko":"일찍 자고 일찍 일어나니까 정말 좋은 것 같아.","zh":"因为早睡早起，感觉真的很好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자고","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일찍","meaning":"早早儿","explanation":"일찍：早早儿","readings":[{"term":"일찍","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26226","senseId":"1","lemma":"일찍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일어나니까","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6b45c134c531ab18","term":"일찍","zh":"早早儿","audio":"/audio/6b45c134c531ab187881.mp3","entryId":"26226","definition":"比指定时间早地。","pronunciation":["일찍"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f907630d511c7759ff4c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62195-1-7-2","ko":"응, 몸도 기분도 산뜻하지?","zh":"嗯，身体和心情都变得很清爽吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸도","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분도","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산뜻하지?","meaning":"清爽，凉爽","explanation":"산뜻하다：清爽，凉爽；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"산뜻하다","audio":"/audio/11fcb0e62a825a5018bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62195","senseId":"1","lemma":"산뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"11fcb0e62a825a50","term":"산뜻하다","zh":"清爽，凉爽","audio":"/audio/11fcb0e62a825a5018bc.mp3","entryId":"62195","definition":"心情或感觉等清新又爽快。","pronunciation":["산뜨타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b01470bb4e2725ef438.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.675,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62195","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4003,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为早睡早起，感觉真的很好呢。","嗯，身体和心情都变得很清爽吧？","我不需要什么帮助。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为早睡早起，感觉真的很好呢。","嗯，身体和心情都变得很清爽吧？","我不需要什么帮助。"],"answer":1}]}
